<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-ST POELTEN GRAND PRIX QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ST POELTEN GRAND PRIX QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ST POELTEN, Austria 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results at the $425,000 St.Poelten Grand Prix men's tennis tournament on Thursday: Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) beat Karim Alami (Morocco) 6-1 6-2  </p>
<p>Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) beat Tomas Nydahl (Sweden) 7-5 6-1  </p>
<p>7-Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat 1-Thomas Muster (Austria) 6-3 7-6 (7-0).</p>
<p>The fourth quarterfinal between Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) and Magnus Norman (Sweden) was interrupted and postponed to Friday with score at 6-1 1-6 for Schalken.</p>
</text>
